# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Kenta Matsutani et al. (2024). Comparison of intermediate-range order in GeO2 glass: Molecular dynamics using machine-learning interatomic potential vs reverse Monte Carlo fitting to experimental data.
#   The Journal of Chemical Physics. doi:10.1063/5.0240087  arXiv:2409.06982v2
#
# Version read: arxiv-preprint arXiv:2409.06982v2 (sha256 147de06ad18a0d6a...);
