# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/matsutani2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the Behler-Parrinello NNP (SIMPLE-NN, 70-30-30-1,
# 6.0 A cutoff) for GeO2 trained on 1,870 VASP PBE configurations from
# crystal, liquid, quench, compressed glass/crystal and off-stoichiometric
# AIMD, and its test energy RMSE on 200 independent quench structures.
# Structure factors, rings and persistent homology are properties.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
